      "created_at": "2019-02-06T18:45:49.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>I created a player aid that can be printed 2sided and laminated, that is about the size of a Spirit Board. I created it by cutting and pasting from pdfs of the rulebooks. It basiclly has the \"New turn order\", \"Tokens\" and \"Aided by\" from Branch &amp; Claw on one side. And \"Range\" \"Iconography\" \"Target\" and the Difficulty chart (new one) on the other side.</p>\n<p>My question is, would it be ok to post it on BGG's Spirit Island File section? Or would it be violating copyright/trademarks?&nbsp;</p>",
